        "id": 1105075
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-01-23T19:30:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "the thing is do we want to have all unbound kernel threads and root and other stuff to have max_clamp? that looks like an overkill, I think for iowait boost is _by_nature_ a boost so better to be linked to min_clamp (which is a boost signal I would image we have for TA and foreground tasks) ?",
      "parentUuid": "41257d4f_eb57e50c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 5208,
        "startChar": 21,
        "endLine": 5208,
        "endChar": 35
      },
      "revId": "494b5dd362e728d2b9e84afb21495ae880e45972",
